<title>USA: Park City, Kan., won by UMB Bank.</title>
<headline>Park City, Kan., won by UMB Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>UMB Bank said it won $1.390 million of Park Cty, Kan., general obligation bonds, Series 1997-1, with a net interest cost of 5.09 percent.</p>
</text>
